#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/clusters.rst:2
msgid "Clusters"
msgstr "Clusters"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/clusters.rst:20
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/clusters.rst:22
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Clusters`` is for creating and managing Kubernetes "
"Clusters, |morpheus| manager Docker Clusters, KVM Clusters, or Cloud "
"specific Kubernetes services such as EKS, AKS and GKE."
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Clusters`` permet de créer et gérer des clusters Kubernetes, des clusters Docker gérés par |morpheus|, des clusters KVM ou des services Kubernetes spécifiques au cloud tels qu'EKS, AKS et GKE."

